      <title>Men's Golf Opens Spring at The Sea Best Invitational</title>
      <link>https://lipscombsports.com/news/2026/2/3/mens-golf-opens-spring-at-the-sea-best-invitational.aspx</link>
      <description>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. – Lipscomb Men's Golf opened up its spring 2026 season at the Sea Best Invitational hosted by Jacksonville, finishing seventh in a field of 14 teams. Included in the field were ranked opponents No. 5 Florida and No. 34 Texas A&amp;amp;M, along with ASUN foes FGCU, North Florida, North Alabama, and Jacksonville. The tournament was shortened to two rounds due to cold, windy conditions.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://lipscombsports.com/news/2026/2/3/mens-golf-opens-spring-at-the-sea-best-invitational.aspx</guid>
